# OKF knowledge rules

- Follow the pinned Open Knowledge Format v0.2 specification linked from `.knowledge/sources/okf-specification.md`.
- Every non-reserved concept must have YAML frontmatter with a non-empty `type`.
- Attribute individual claims using stable `sources[].id` values and Markdown footnotes.
- Prefer current primary sources; record retrieval dates and exact product/version applicability.
- Keep `generated`, `verified`, `status` and `stale_after` truthful. Never invent human review or source metadata.
- Update the nearest `index.md` and `.knowledge/log.md` when changing bundle content.
- See `.agents/skills/maintain-okf-knowledge/SKILL.md`.
